# Content-types

Git JSON under `src/api/` is the schema. Do not remodel these as SQL migrations or add `post_transaction()`.

- Keep [`src/api/member/content-types/member/lifecycles.ts`](src/api/member/content-types/member/lifecycles.ts) (member → account).
- `draftAndPublish` stays on `transaction` and `receipt` only.
- `debit_account` / `credit_account` are not required yet. Mark `required: true` only in the days 30–60 window, still in `schema.json` — not a Postgres CHECK.

```json
